brief:
A square card for a podcast episode, 1080×1080 px, as a PNG.

- Background #fef3c7, 80px padding, everything centered.
- Fonts: Inter (regular and bold), in fonts/.
- Stacked from the top:
  - the show's cover, assets/podcast-cover.png (a 600×600 file), shown 360×360 with 24px rounded corners;
  - "EPISODE 42": Inter bold, 28px, #b45309, letter spacing 3px;
  - "Designing APIs that agents can read": Inter bold, 64px, #1c1917, centered, at most 2 lines;
  - "with Priya Natarajan": Inter regular, 32px, #44403c.
- At the bottom of the card: "The Build Log" (Inter bold, 28px, #1c1917) above "Listen wherever you get podcasts" (Inter regular, 24px, #78716c).
